{"id": "EUVD-2026-92052", "enisaUuid": "c56bd880-0f25-3904-b5db-e248d6627bdc", "description": "LaraDashboard from 1.4.0 before 1.4.8 contains a race condition vulnerability in RegisterController::register that allows unauthenticated attackers to bypass the per-IP daily registration limit. Attackers can send many concurrent registration requests from one IP so all pass RegistrationGuardService::hasExceededIpLimit before recordRegistration runs, creating accounts in bulk and defeating anti-automation controls.", "datePublished": "2026-10-03T23:40:02", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T16:14:41", "baseScore": 6.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/laradashboard/laradashboard/security/advisories/GHSA-gw6g-9wx9-3fpj", "https://github.com/laradashboard/laradashboard/blob/v1.4.2/app/Http/Controllers/Auth/RegisterController.php#L175-L188", "https://github.com/laradashboard/laradashboard/blob/v1.4.2/app/Services/Auth/RegistrationGuardService.php#L77-L105", "https://github.com/laradashboard/laradashboard/pull/343", "https://github.com/laradashboard/laradashboard/commit/1bc7b7e2d32dd0bbee8f39a7ed8a3316ae657d50", "https://github.com/laradashboard/laradashboard/releases/tag/v1.4.8", "https://github.com/laradashboard/laradashboard", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/laradashboard-1.4.0-before-1.4.8-race-condition-bypasses-per-ip-registration-limit"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m6xm-3prx-hrjp", "CVE-2026-105130"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1d5d29a8-71e4-3784-b7a3-9441e7aca58b", "product": {"name": "laradashboard", "vendor": {"name": "laradashboard"}}, "product_version": "1.4.0 <1.4.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c859dc36-db5b-34c6-8d1f-278e17b1c4ae", "vendor": {"name": "laradashboard"}}], "isExploited": false}